    "title": "Monroe County authorities search for man wanted for multiple identity theft, fraud charges - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Leah Kincaid ,\n4 hours ago MONROE COUNTY, Ga. (WGXA) — The Monroe County Sheriff's Office (MCSO) is hoping the community can help locate a man wanted for multiple identity fraud charges. Daeshuan Gregory Boyd, 36, is currently wanted for forgery 1st degree, identity fraud, financial transaction card fraud and theft by deception in Monroe County, the sheriff's office says. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
